{
  "name": "Social Publishing - Webhook Receiver",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "social-publishing",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {
          "allowedOrigins": "*"
        }
      },
      "id": "webhook-trigger",
      "name": "Webhook - Publication réseaux sociaux",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [250, 300],
      "webhookId": "social-publishing"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rules": {
          "values": [
            {
              "conditions": {
                "options": {
                  "caseSensitive": true,
                  "leftValue": "",
                  "typeValidation": "strict"
                },
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "leftValue": "={{ $json.action }}",
                    "rightValue": "now",
                    "operator": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "operation": "equals"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "combinator": "and"
              },
              "renameOutput": true,
              "outputKey": "now"
            },
            {
              "conditions": {
                "options": {
                  "caseSensitive": true,
                  "leftValue": "",
                  "typeValidation": "strict"
                },
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "leftValue": "={{ $json.action }}",
                    "rightValue": "schedule",
                    "operator": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "operation": "equals"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "combinator": "and"
              },
              "renameOutput": true,
              "outputKey": "schedule"
            },
            {
              "conditions": {
                "options": {
                  "caseSensitive": true,
                  "leftValue": "",
                  "typeValidation": "strict"
                },
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "leftValue": "={{ $json.action }}",
                    "rightValue": "queue",
                    "operator": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "operation": "equals"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "combinator": "and"
              },
              "renameOutput": true,
              "outputKey": "queue"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "switch-router",
      "name": "Switch - Router par action",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.switch",
      "typeVersion": 3,
      "position": [450, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Route NOW - Publication immédiate\nconst platforms = $input.item.json.payload.platforms;\nconst article = $input.item.json.payload.article;\nconst customMessage = $input.item.json.payload.custom_message;\n\n// Create message\nconst message = customMessage || `${article.title}\\n\\n${article.excerpt}\\n\\nLire la suite : ${article.url}\\n\\n#${article.category || ''} ${article.tags ? article.tags.map(t => '#' + t).join(' ') : ''}`;\n\n// Return array of items, one per platform\nreturn platforms.map(platform => ({\n  json: {\n    platform,\n    message,\n    article,\n    imageUrl: article.image_url\n  }\n}));"
      },
      "id": "now-prepare",
      "name": "NOW - Préparer publications",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [650, 200]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Route SCHEDULE - Attendre puis publier\nconst scheduledFor = $input.item.json.payload.scheduled_for;\nconst platforms = $input.item.json.payload.platforms;\nconst article = $input.item.json.payload.article;\nconst customMessage = $input.item.json.payload.custom_message;\n\n// Create message\nconst message = customMessage || `${article.title}\\n\\n${article.excerpt}\\n\\nLire la suite : ${article.url}\\n\\n#${article.category || ''} ${article.tags ? article.tags.map(t => '#' + t).join(' ') : ''}`;\n\nreturn {\n  json: {\n    scheduledFor,\n    platforms,\n    message,\n    article,\n    imageUrl: article.image_url\n  }\n};"
      },
      "id": "schedule-prepare",
      "name": "SCHEDULE - Préparer données",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [650, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "amount": "={{ $json.scheduledFor }}",
        "unit": "seconds"
      },
      "id": "schedule-wait",
      "name": "Wait - Attendre scheduled_for",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.wait",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [850, 300],
      "webhookId": "{{ $json.id }}"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Calculate next scheduled_for for queue\nconst queueTime = '09:00'; // TODO: Récupérer depuis settings Supabase\n\n// Create tomorrow's date at the configured time\nconst tomorrow = new Date();\ntomorrow.setDate(tomorrow.getDate() + 1);\nconst [hours, minutes] = queueTime.split(':');\ntomorrow.setHours(parseInt(hours), parseInt(minutes), 0, 0);\n\nconst platforms = $input.item.json.payload.platforms;\nconst article = $input.item.json.payload.article;\nconst customMessage = $input.item.json.payload.custom_message;\nconst userId = $input.item.json.userId;\n\nreturn {\n  json: {\n    article_id: article.id,\n    article_title: article.title,\n    article_url: article.url,\n    article_excerpt: article.excerpt,\n    article_image_url: article.image_url,\n    article_category: article.category,\n    article_tags: article.tags,\n    platforms,\n    custom_message: customMessage,\n    user_id: userId,\n    status: 'pending',\n    scheduled_for: tomorrow.toISOString()\n  }\n};"
      },
      "id": "queue-calculate",
      "name": "QUEUE - Calculer scheduled_for",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [650, 400]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "insert",
        "tableId": "social_queue",
        "dataMode": "autoMapInputData",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "queue-insert",
      "name": "Supabase - Insérer dans queue",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.supabase",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [850, 400],
      "credentials": {
        "supabaseApi": {
          "id": "supabase-credentials",
          "name": "Supabase API"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "json",
        "responseBody": "={{ { \"success\": true, \"message\": \"Article ajouté à la file d'attente\", \"scheduled_for\": $json.scheduled_for } }}"
      },
      "id": "queue-response",
      "name": "Response - Queue OK",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [1050, 400]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rules": {
          "values": [
            {
              "conditions": {
                "options": {
                  "caseSensitive": true
                },
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "leftValue": "={{ $json.platform }}",
                    "rightValue": "facebook",
                    "operator": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "operation": "equals"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              "renameOutput": true,
              "outputKey": "facebook"
            },
            {
              "conditions": {
                "options": {
                  "caseSensitive": true
                },
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "leftValue": "={{ $json.platform }}",
                    "rightValue": "linkedin",
                    "operator": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "operation": "equals"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              "renameOutput": true,
              "outputKey": "linkedin"
            },
            {
              "conditions": {
                "options": {
                  "caseSensitive": true
                },
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "leftValue": "={{ $json.platform }}",
                    "rightValue": "instagram",
                    "operator": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "operation": "equals"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              "renameOutput": true,
              "outputKey": "instagram"
            },
            {
              "conditions": {
                "options": {
                  "caseSensitive": true
                },
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "leftValue": "={{ $json.platform }}",
                    "rightValue": "tiktok",
                    "operator": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "operation": "equals"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              "renameOutput": true,
              "outputKey": "tiktok"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "platform-router",
      "name": "Switch - Router par plateforme",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.switch",
      "typeVersion": 3,
      "position": [850, 200]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "=https://graph.facebook.com/v18.0/{{ $env.FACEBOOK_PAGE_ID }}/feed",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "bodyParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "message",
              "value": "={{ $json.message }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "link",
              "value": "={{ $json.article.url }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "publish-facebook",
      "name": "Facebook - Publier",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.1,
      "position": [1050, 100],
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "facebook-auth",
          "name": "Facebook Header Auth"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "https://api.linkedin.com/v2/ugcPosts",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ {\n  \"author\": \"urn:li:organization:\" + $env.LINKEDIN_ORGANIZATION_ID,\n  \"lifecycleState\": \"PUBLISHED\",\n  \"specificContent\": {\n    \"com.linkedin.ugc.ShareContent\": {\n      \"shareCommentary\": {\n        \"text\": $json.message\n      },\n      \"shareMediaCategory\": \"ARTICLE\",\n      \"media\": [\n        {\n          \"status\": \"READY\",\n          \"originalUrl\": $json.article.url\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  },\n  \"visibility\": {\n    \"com.linkedin.ugc.MemberNetworkVisibility\": \"PUBLIC\"\n  }\n} }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "publish-linkedin",
      "name": "LinkedIn - Publier",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.1,
      "position": [1050, 200],
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "linkedin-auth",
          "name": "LinkedIn Header Auth"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "json",
        "responseBody": "={{ { \"success\": true, \"message\": \"Publications en cours\", \"platforms\": $json.platforms } }}"
      },
      "id": "now-response",
      "name": "Response - NOW OK",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [1250, 200]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "json",
        "responseBody": "={{ { \"success\": true, \"message\": \"Publication programmée\", \"scheduled_for\": $json.scheduledFor } }}"
      },
      "id": "schedule-response",
      "name": "Response - SCHEDULE OK",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [1250, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Instructions:\n\n1. **Credentials à configurer:**\n   - Supabase API (pour queue)\n   - Facebook Header Auth: Authorization: Bearer YOUR_FACEBOOK_TOKEN\n   - LinkedIn Header Auth: Authorization: Bearer YOUR_LINKEDIN_TOKEN\n\n2. **Variables d'environnement:**\n   - FACEBOOK_PAGE_ID\n   - LINKEDIN_ORGANIZATION_ID\n\n3. **Instagram & TikTok:**\n   Ajoutez des noeuds HTTP Request similaires avec vos credentials\n\n4. **Test:**\n   Activez le workflow et testez depuis l'UI Next.js"
      },
      "id": "sticky-note",
      "name": "Note - Configuration",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [250, 100]
    }
  ],
